---
<Layout title="Editors Gurukul | Free Filmmaking Guides, LUTs & Courses" description="Editors Gurukul offers free filmmaking guides, LUT resources, camera cheat sheets, and premium courses for creators and editors.">

    <!-- 1. VERY TOP HERO: Flagship Course Showcase Banner -->
