                    <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-[#e4f5f4] mb-3 leading-relaxed">
                        If you want to master professional color grading, video editing, and build a high-income creative career...
                    </p>
                    
                    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white/80 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                        Learn real production node trees, CST color management, skin tone grading, Fairlight audio post, and AI tools directly from a working DOP.
                    </p>

                    <!-- Value Chips -->
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white/90">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/10 rounded-lg border border-white/15">✓ Node-Based Grading</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/10 rounded-lg border border-white/15">✓ Log to Rec.709 Transforms</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/10 rounded-lg border border-white/15">✓ AI Neural Engine Tools</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-white/10 rounded-lg border border-white/15">✓ Real Project Files</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- CTA Actions -->
