                    <a href="https://www.ajaykmeena.com/courses/Decoding-DaVinci-Resolve-20--The-Ultimate-course-for-Video-Editing-Color-Grading--AI-Powered-Filmmaking-69b89bb32c97f8fb76db7ee8" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-8 py-4 bg-[#e0692a] text-white font-extrabold text-base sm:text-lg rounded-full text-center hover:bg-[#c85720] transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 shadow-lg hover:shadow-orange-500/40 no-underline">
                        Enroll in Decoding DaVinci 2.0 🎓
                    </a>
                    <a href="/decoding-davinci-20-course" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-white/10 text-white font-bold text-sm sm:text-base rounded-full text-center hover:bg-white/20 transition-all border border-white/20 no-underline">
                        Explore Course Curriculum →
